<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>
<simplesect><title>template&lt;typename <link linkend="__u_p_r_i_s_e___e_n_g_i_n_e_2_header_e_2_c_o_r_e_2_c___i_n_p_u_t_8h_1a0acb682b8260ab1c60b918599864e2e5">T</link>, unsigned int Capacity&gt;<?linebreak?>class Assimp::SmallVector&lt; T, Capacity &gt;</title></simplesect>

<para>Small vector with inplace storage. </para>



<para>Reduces heap allocations when list is shorter. It uses a small array for a dedicated size. When the growing gets bigger than this small cache a dynamic growing algorithm will be used. </para>
</section>
